# W31d, b (k10): joins a in stag0201 and falls there (the development test hook: TEST defeat in its sealed stage group)
# before a goes in: no notice while it is defeated; c's GO takes it along (the side rule), it comes back in dng204b1.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log b in stag0201
idle until present=4,sealed>=300 or epoch>=@460 fail stagechange
idle until epoch>=@470 fail stagechange
testhook defeat until dead fail frames>=600
log b fell
idle until stage=dng204b1 fail notices>=1,epoch>=@1200
log b taken along into dng204b1 without a notice
idle until present=4,sealed>=300,alive fail epoch>=@1200
log b alive in B1 with a, c and d
idle until frames>=1200
